sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant App as Hawk app
  participant Fn as Cloud Functions
  participant DB as Firestore (emailChallenges)
  participant Mail as Email provider
  participant Auth as Firebase Auth
  U->>App: enter email address
  App->>Fn: request_email_code(email)
  Fn->>Fn: generate a 6-digit code
  Fn->>DB: store HMAC(code), expires in 10 min
  Fn->>Mail: send the code
  Mail-->>U: email with the code
  U->>App: type the code
  App->>Fn: verify_email_code(email, code)
  Fn->>DB: compare HMAC, count attempts (max 5)
  Fn->>Auth: find or create the user, create_custom_token()
  Fn-->>App: custom token
  App->>Auth: signInWithCustomToken()
  Auth-->>App: ordinary Firebase session (ID token)
